    capturedFile: "2015-sponsor.html",
    bodyHtml: `<div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
          <h2>Sponsors</h2>
          <p>
            The conference has proven to attract participants usually scattered in their own
 different groups. By becoming a sponsor, your organisation will be able to build relationships with them. Please refer to our <a href="/2015/sponsor/prospectus/">sponsor prospectus</a> on web site.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>Gold Sponsors</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="https://www.elastic.co/"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/elastic.png" alt="Elastic" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://cyberport.hk/en"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/cyberport.jpg" alt="Cyberport" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>Bronze Sponsors</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://m-labs.hk/"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/m-labs.png" alt="M-Labs Limited" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p>Based in Hong Kong and operating worldwide, M-Labs Ltd develops bespoke software, gateware and electronics for cutting-edge physics experiments. The company's current main project is ARTIQ, a next-generation control system for quantum mechanics experiments with trapped ions. The system is developed in collaboration with the Ion Storage Group (Nobel Prize 2012 in Physics) of the National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) in the US.</p>
           <p>If fundamental science matters to you and you love hacking, you should get in touch.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://www.microsoft.com"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/microsoft.png" alt="Microsoft Corp." style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p>Microsoft is one of Bronze Sponsors at PyCon HK 2015.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://www.odd-e.com"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/odd-e.jpg" alt="Odd-e" style="margin: 10px 10px" width="160px" height="160px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p>Odd-e, based in Asia, is a company with a passion about building products better. We provide Agile coaching, training and consulting services to software and product development companies. Our team consists of experienced coaches and trainers, who work according to the values of Scrum, Agile, Lean, and Craftsmanship. Currently, we have teams in Singapore, Hong Kong, Japan, Korea, Thailand, the Philippines, and China.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://www.oursky.com"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/oursky.jpg" alt="Oursky Limited" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p>Proudly based in Hong Kong, Oursky builds digital products with amazing experiences. Our small team of 30 creative minds turn great ideas into products, with a lean, analytical and iterative process.</p>
          <p>We plan, implement, launch and grow product ideas through Wireframing, UI / UX Design, Web / Mobile App Development and post-launch analytics with AB testing, retention and on-boarding optimisation.</p>
          <p>We have developed multiple in-house and work-for-hire iOS and Android apps with over 3M downloads, with multiple Apple App Store Features and Awards including one of the “Best of 2013”.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>General Sponsors</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://www.gandi.net/"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/gandi.jpg" alt="Gandi APAC" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p>Gandi is the No Bullshit™ domain name registrar and hosting provider. Created in France in 1999, Gandi is now present in 3 continents,with offices in Paris, San Francisco, Luxembourg,and Taipei. We position ourselves as the next port of call for those who want to create an online presence, right after Internet access providers, since domain names are the firststep in creating your own piece of the Internet.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="https://www.jetbrains.com/pycharm/"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/jetbrains.png" alt="Jetbrains" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <p>JetBrains PyCharm is the most intelligent Python IDE providing a complete set of tools for productive Python, Django and Web development. PyCharm comes in three editions. The free and open-source PyCharm Community Edition is perfect for pure Python coding. PyCharm Professional Edition is designed for professional Python and Web developers. Novice programmers should choose PyCharm Educational Edition for learning programming with Python easily and effectively.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>Organisers</h2>
      <p>We would like to thank our organisers to provide their resources, fundings, and personal donations & efforts to PyCon Hong Kong 2015.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">      
          <p><a href="http://cota.hk"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/hkcota.png" alt="Hong Kong Creative Open Technology Association Limited" style="margin: 10px 10px" width="180px" height="118px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
           <p>Hong Kong Creative Open Technology Association (HKCOTA) is a non- profit (pending) organisation founded in 2014 to promote Open Standards; Free and Open Source Software; Open Hardware; Free Culture Works, Open Content and Creative Commons.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://opensource.hk"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/opensourcehk.png" alt="Open Source Hong Kong" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
           <p>Open Source Hong Kong (OSHK) is a community in aim of advocacy and promotion on concepts and uses of open source, to organise meet-ups, seminars, conferences and other events in Hong Kong and Asia. OSHK encourages communication and collaboration of open source, open technology and open culture related communities in Hong Kong and the world. OSHK established 2 annual conferences - Hong Kong Open Source Conference (HKOSCon) in 2013 and PyCon HK in 2015.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <p><a href="http://cyberport.hk/en"><image src="/2015/images/sponsors/cyberport.jpg" alt="Cyberport" style="margin: 10px 10px"></a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-8">
           <p></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>Special Thanks</h2>
      <p>We would also like to say thanks to <a href="https://www.python.org/psf/">Python Software Foundation</a> to grant some funds to PyCon Hong Kong 2015. Thanks PSF!</p>

      <hr>

      <footer>
        <p>&copy; PyCON HK 2015</p>
      </footer>
    </div> <!-- /container -->`,
